                <li><b>Included</b><span>PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka and OpenFGA; none of them exposed</span></li>
                <li><b>HTTPS</b><span>A local CA and certificate are generated on first start</span></li>
                <li><b>First sign-in</b><span>As <code>admin</code>; you change the password on first sign-in</span></li>
            </ul>
